Step 8: Understanding SSL Termination

The module introduced SSL termination.

Normally:

Client
   ↓ HTTPS
Server

Server performs encryption and decryption.

With Application Gateway:

Client
    ↓ HTTPS
Application Gateway
    ↓ HTTP
Backend Server
Benefits:
Reduced server workload
Centralized certificate management
Improved performance
Key concepts learned:
Application Gateway handles encryption
Backend servers perform less processing
SSL certificates are managed centrally
