Step 11: Application Gateway vs Load Balancer

The module compared Application Gateway and Azure Load Balancer.

Feature	Load Balancer	Application Gateway
OSI Layer	Layer 4	Layer 7
TCP/UDP Support	Yes	No
URL Routing	No	Yes
SSL Termination	No	Yes
Web Application Firewall	No	Yes
HTTP/HTTPS Awareness	No	Yes
Key lesson learned:
Use Load Balancer for network traffic
Use Application Gateway for web applications

This comparison is frequently tested on the AZ-104 exam.

